<view class="page {{theme}}"><view class="row"><text class="eyebrow">ASK &amp; UNDERSTAND</text><button class="text-button" bindtap="onNew">新建对话</button></view><view class="title">AI 学习助手</view><view wx:if="{{!available}}" class="info">{{reason}}<button class="text-button" bindtap="onSettings">查看服务设置</button></view><view class="chips"><button class="chip {{mode === 'chat' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="chat" bindtap="onMode">自由问答</button><button class="chip {{mode === 'explain' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="explain" bindtap="onMode">词句讲解</button><button class="chip {{mode === 'writing' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="writing" bindtap="onMode">写作批改</button><button class="chip {{mode === 'summarize' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="summarize" bindtap="onMode">阅读摘要</button></view><view class="messages"><view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="index" id="message-{{index}}" class="message {{item.role}}"><text class="eyebrow">{{item.role === 'user' ? '我' : '学习助手'}}</text><text class="message-content" selectable="true">{{item.content}}</text><view wx:if="{{item.incomplete}}" class="small muted">模型输出达到长度上限，此回复未完整结束。</view><button class="text-button" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onCopy">复制</button></view><view wx:if="{{!messages.length}}" class="empty">可以询问用法、易混词、句子结构或写作问题。<view>回答由你配置的真实模型服务提供。</view></view></view><textarea class="field compose" value="{{input}}" bindinput="onInput" maxlength="6000" placeholder="输入问题或待修改的英文…"/><view class="actions"><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !available}}" bindtap="onSend">发送</button><button disabled="{{busy || !session}}" bindtap="onDelete">删除当前对话</button></view><view class="footer">点击发送后，当前对话上下文会发送至已配置的模型服务。本机笔记不会自动加入对话。请自行核对模型回答中的事实与用法。</view><view wx:if="{{sessions.length}}"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">本机对话</text></view><view class="card"><button wx:for="{{sessions}}" wx:key="id" class="word-row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onSelect">{{item.title}}</button></view></view></view>
